riments require additional energy.", "Your systems require upgrades.", "Acquire more points for scientific advancement.", "My experiments require more cryogenic energy.", "Your appetite is greater than your funds.", "Mauga don’t fight for free—bring more points.", "Precision firepower demands more than pocket change.", "Secrets cost more than this—get points.", "Blink into affordability first.", "Patience. True precision is expensive.", "Even a scientist can’t fund this plan without points.", "Momentum denied—insufficient funding.", "Evolution requires greater investment.", "Freja needs more strength… and more points.", "Hazard requires more resources to unleash chaos.", "Sunlight blooms only with more offerings.", "Queens don’t fight for free—show respect with points.", "Life demands greater sacrifice than this.", "Juno waits for those who invest more.", "Even the clever fox needs more offerings.", "Vision requires funding, sharpshooter.", "Venture deeper only when you can afford it.", "A bounty hunter needs a bigger stake.", "My struggle continues, but not without points."], [Hero.Ana, Hero.Anran, Hero.Ashe, Hero.Baptiste, Hero.Bastion, Hero.Brigitte, Hero.Cassidy, Hero.Dva, Hero.Domina, Hero.Doomfist, Hero.Echo, Hero.Emre, Hero.Freja, Hero.Genji, Hero.Hanzo, Hero.Hazard, Hero.Illari, Hero.JetpackCat, Hero.JunkerQueen, Hero.Junkrat, Hero.Juno, Hero.Kiriko, Hero.Lifeweaver, Hero.Lucio, Hero.Mauga, Hero.Mei, Hero.Mercy, Hero.Mizuki, Hero.Moira, Hero.Orisa, Hero.Pharah, Hero.Ramattra, Hero.Reaper, Hero.Reinhardt, Hero.Roadhog, Hero.Sigma, Hero.Sojourn, Hero.Soldier76, Hero.Sombra, Hero.Symmetra, Hero.Torbjorn, Hero.Tracer, Hero.Vendetta, Hero.Venture, Hero.Widowmaker, Hero.Winston, Hero.WreckingBall, Hero.Wuyang, Hero.Zarya, Hero.Zenyatta], [Hero.Anran, Hero.Ashe, Hero.Bastion, Hero.Cassidy, Hero.Echo, Hero.Emre, Hero.Freja, Hero.Genji, Hero.Hanzo, Hero.Junkrat, Hero.Mei, Hero.Pharah, Hero.Reaper, Hero.Sojourn, Hero.Soldier76, Hero.Sombra, Hero.Symmetra, Hero.Torbjor